{"text": "The square was crowded with people and animals, and the air was full of shouting, laughing, and the smell of cattle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Farmers bargained for a long time over every cow and pig, always afraid that someone might cheat them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At noon, the crowd went to Jourdains inn, where a great fire was roasting chickens, pigeons, and legs of lamb. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The diners ate and drank happily, talking loudly about the weather and the harvest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly a drum sounded in the courtyard, and everyone except a few who did not care ran to the doors and windows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The town crier announced that a black leather pocketbook had been lost that morning on the road to Beuzeville. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It held five hundred francs and some business papers, and the finder would receive a reward of twenty francs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The owner, Maître Houlbrèque of Manneville, asked the finder to bring it to the mayors office or to him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As the diners were guessing who might find it, a police officer appeared at the door of the dining room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked for Maître Hauchecorne of Bréauté and told him that the mayor wished to speak with him at once.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "s", "q", "u", "a", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "r", "o", "w", "d", "e", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", "n", "i", "m", "a", "l", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "i", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "u", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "s", "h", "o", "u", "t", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "l", "a", "u", "g", "h", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "m", "e", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "c", "a", "t", "t", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", 